# L §5.14.1, E §3.1 step 7 (tally 2.1.7 R6, issue #145; G5): a plan reaching next over a decision's movements
# makes the running read its binding makes: LOAD-READS. 2.1.6's refcore gave the HOLE-NOTYET of a binding not yet
# planned.
=== m.tally
model g5
  tally 2
  on 2025-01-01
  start 2025-01-01
  end 2025-03-31
unit DUK: currency minor 0.01
kind pays: event certain
  leg cash: DUK
place konto: accounts DUK lives 2025-01-01..
place world: outside lives 2025-01-01..
move pay[m in months]: pays
  on end_of(m) - 1 day
  when bal(konto) > 0 or pos(m) > 1
  reads konto
  leg cash from world to konto amount 1
move fee[m in months]: transfers
  on next(pays, start_of(m)).day
  leg cash from world to konto amount 1
ask q: bal(konto, 2025-03-31)
=== expect
refused: LOAD-READS fee reaches a running read or projection of pay without reads pay ...
